Source: aria-tailcat
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: jia <jia@ariacompute.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), golang-any
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://ariacompute.com

Package: aria-tailcat
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: Deployment launcher for tailscale/tailcat on ariacompute
 Wraps github.com/tailscale/tailcat (a control-plane-free, WireGuard+DERP
 point-to-point tunnel) as a long-running ariacompute service. Resolves
 configuration from YAML/flags/env and runs the tailcat server in-process via
 the imported github.com/tailscale/tailcat module (no separate tailcat binary is
 executed or bundled).
